    "description": "Schlage built the Encode Plus around two things people actually ask for: Wi-Fi without a hub and Apple Home Key. The deadbolt replaces your existing one, adds a keypad, and connects directly to your home network, so the app can lock the door from the office or send an alert when a code is used. Home Key support means an iPhone or Apple Watch can unlock the door with a tap, with no app to open, which owners commonly describe as the point where a smart lock starts to feel like a normal door. The lock is sold in different finishes and with different trim styles, and Schlage publishes compatibility notes for the Home Key and Wi-Fi features, so check that your phone and home network meet them. Expect to give up some battery life in exchange for the built-in radio."
